	quest.298F5706DE09FD5F.quest_desc: ["&4IMPORTANT!&r This is everything you need to auto-craft with &zmulti-block&r machines. You will create a &e'sub-net'&r for this &aauto-crafting&r. You will need to set up a &c'pattern provider'&r in the &nmain network&r and face with &linterface&r. You will need to power the &linterface&r with &9quartz&r from the &nmain network&r to the &3sub-net&r. You will also need to set up the &2'hatches'&r with a &6'storage bus'&r. For the &opattern provider&r, &5select blocking mode&r to &nproduce one pattern&r of items per process. For the &5storage bus&r, select &8'report inaccessible items'&r."]
