	quest.3757FE3AC6956B65.quest_desc: [
		"&6Quarry Clearing Mode &7— The Only Way to Mine Properly&r"
		"&7Unlike the &cnormal building mode&r, which fills every mined block with useless &bdirt&r — turning your hard work into a messy, unproductive wasteland — the &aQuarry Clearing Mode&r &7is designed for &btrue excavation&r. It &aremoves blocks completely&r, &bdrops their raw resources&r, and leaves behind a &eclean, empty space&r. &6No dirt. No clutter. Just pure, efficient mining.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&bHow to Set It Up&r"
		"&7Forget right-clicking the card in your hand — that’s slow, imprecise, and outdated. The &ereal method&r is simple: &eshift-click&r the &aQuarry Shape Card&r directly onto the &bRFTools Builder&r while standing in front of it. The Builder will instantly enter &9Point Selection Mode&r."
		""
		"&7First, &9look at the corner&r you want to start from — &cleft click&r to lock it in. Then, &9move to the far opposite corner&r — even if it’s high above or far below — and &cleft click&r again. The Builder will &aautomatically detect the full 3D volume&r between those two points. &aNo numbers. No guessing. No mistakes.&r"
	]
