	quest.69C5146E8D316946.quest_desc: [
		"There are a lot of commands in GandI, but I have selected the best ones for you:"
		""
		"&#458DFF/sethome (name you want)&r is the most important one."
		"&eExplaning:&r Use this command to save your current location as a home point. Later, you can instantly teleport back to that spot with &e/home&r."
		""
		"It's a quick way to return to your &lfavourite&r place or base at any time!"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&e/spawn&r: This will teleport you to the spawn point of your overworld."
		"Useful if you're lost in other &4dimensions!&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&e/rtp&r: Stands for '&5Random teleport&r' and is useful for &aexploring&r. It works in other dimensions too!"
		""
		"&dQuick tip&r: &4Do not&r use it in dimensions such as the &4End&r, as it will cause &4freezing and lag&r in those dimensions."
	]
